      "text": "# Task 7 controller ruling 25 — minimum proven knowledge fence and API correction\n\nRuling: implement the proven knowledge-upsert fence INLINE in the existing generic SECDEF command, immediately after its existing result-null/P0002 check and before audit, only for that upsert branch. Use the saved actual result's is_published and three document UUID fields, sorted DISTINCT non-null refs; read public.document_assets where id matches AND is_published=true FOR UPDATE, throwing the exact existing modern23514/message if absent/unpublished. Preserve all other original business tails, signatures/defaults/actor fences, post→asset lock order, missing-post priority, audit and return semantics. Add only the needed local UUID variable. No new helper/trigger/grant/default/owner/version policy or legacy replay.\nBind document_assets as an additional exact prerequisite table (15total), including complete captured owner/fullACL/grantoptions/RLS/columns/constraints/indexes/native/helper/default metadata; preserve captured hosted absence and exact modern helpers rather than altering them. Unknownmetadata must55000 before mutation. Include own focused drift/refusal/rollback checks after an accepted baseline. For the actual knowledge HTTP42501 defect, add only exact non-null object.code42501→jsonNoStore({error:'Forbidden'},{status:403}) after existing Response/Zod/P0002/23514 branches; preserve existing404/409/unknown500 and no-store.\nReason: controller read the actual0pass2fail hosted receipt/rawlog: unchangeda2 accepted a published post referencing an unpublished PDF and produced post1/audit1 inside a subsequently rolled-back transaction; actual knowledge handler42501returned500. The subsequent actual0pass3fail receipt also establishes command-first independent asset-unpublish is not blocked by existing FK KEYSHARE. Root independently read the original generic SQL and20260926150000 exact AFTER constraint helper; its sorted3UUID/is_published=true/FORUPDATE/23514 semantics already define the required policy. Current HTTP already maps23514 to409; no new conflict policy is needed.\nCost if wrong: wrong placement/refs/casts could change missing/FK/error priorities, deadlock through asset→post inversions, block valid external-link/draft posts or leave audit partial commits. Prove invalid/unpublished and valid/NULL/external/draft references, create/update/missing/auditrollback, both asset-lock transaction orders and actual handler neighboring contracts; keep exact modern helper owner/rawACLnull/default0/body7a8243945ec1787cabf1dac28587f0a3 unchanged. Freeze and rerun final own hosted+modern compositions, all mandatory4gates, bind currentfinalbytes/oldimmutablemaps/shortpath translations, then independent fulltaskreview and fresh exact-head5CI. No source/DB/application claim may reusea2Gate2 as proof of the new body; public146 count unchanged, production44gaps and no new production/release/Task1 authority."
